:: Carter Hero Award Part 5 [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 20>>
The mood is still pretty high when you arrive at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s house, though his brother and dad do visibly get a little nervous as you all walk up to the door. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>, however, doesn’t seem bothered at all and quickly rushes inside once he smells the pizza from just outside the door. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Pizza!”</span> He shouts happily as he runs in and over to the kitchen, where his mom is placing down a collection of 3 pizza boxes onto the counter. <br>

